&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1%E5%99%A8?type=0&quot;&gt;#路由器#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/NAS?type=0&quot;&gt;#NAS#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/3c1cb2e975231141ff5d357155cd91ea.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/c11c14db75fd78c4899b40edbe68ef36.jpg&quot; &gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72344023</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72344023</guid><pubDate>Sun, 14 Jun 2026 14:59:07 GMT</pubDate><author>学园长</author></item><item><title>#飞牛私有云fnOS# #NAS# 出一个j1900 4+120g</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E9%A3%9E%E7%89%9B%E7%A7%81%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%91fnOS?type=0&quot;&gt;#飞牛私有云fnOS#&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/NAS?type=0&quot;&gt;#NAS#&lt;/a&gt; 出一个j1900 4+120g&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/ee23d191acd37ab8d9543fd0c6fd5af6.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/d887649561e2735a9a2519b0a622b9c0.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/d70197558cdfb719598552af643fc365.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/b07671844fb84246ea8e6ee26ff04470.jpg&quot; &gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72343327</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72343327</guid><pubDate>Sun, 14 Jun 2026 14:17:08 GMT</pubDate><author>小辉同学0128</author></item><item><title>#NAS# 各位老板，我想自组装nas，配件全新二手无所谓。主要是想要N150这种或者上12100T这种。网卡最好双2.5G的。功耗尽量小一点。内存16➕128就行。求推荐配件自...</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/NAS?type=0&quot;&gt;#NAS#&lt;/a&gt;  各位老板，我想自组装nas，配件全新二手无所谓。主要是想要N150这种或者上12100T这种。网卡最好双2.5G的。功耗尽量小一点。内存16➕128就行。求推荐配件自组的。谢谢！我现在用的是蜗牛矿渣j1900的